  triage:description "AX.5 QA-1 (quality-mgr ax5-qa-r1, PR #1201 Final Quality Report 2026-09-05T12:38Z) at head da823baaa0018933f8daac388733c51eb14e9335. req-qa: only the drain-first/cadence (ax5_01-style) and blocked (ax5_06-style) per-property tests exist of the 8 named per-property tests in the sprint doc's Required validation section (docs/plans/phase-ax/sprint-AX.5-task-reminder-cycle.md:286ff). Properties 1, 3, 4 and 8 have no test. Fix: add the missing per-property tests in the crates/atm-http-runtime/src/herdr_queue_wake.rs tests module (or the crate's tests/ dir) following the clock-seam pattern of the existing cadence tests, one test per named property, deterministic (no sleeps)." ;
